Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.00,0:00:05.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,That's our rate on a four\Npound coffee.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.84,0:00:06.88,Cap,,0,0,0,,It's terrible.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:08.06,0:00:09.06,Cap,,0,0,0,,One point three percent,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.22,0:00:10.36,Cap,,0,0,0,,plus eight pence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.26,0:00:12.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,On four pounds,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.42,0:00:13.50,Cap,,0,0,0,,that's thirteen pence.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.52,0:00:15.92,Cap,,0,0,0,,Which is three point\Nthree percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.12,0:00:19.26,Cap,,0,0,0,,A flat rate with no fixed fee\Nwould charge you half that.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.26,0:00:21.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,On a four pound sale,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.92,0:00:22.48,Cap,,0,0,0,,we lose.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.34,0:00:24.12,Cap,,0,0,0,,Same rate card.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.44,0:00:25.56,Cap,,0,0,0,,Forty pound sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.52,0:00:27.98,Cap,,0,0,0,,One point five percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.46,0:00:29.58,Cap,,0,0,0,,Now we're the cheaper one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.24,0:00:31.72,Cap,,0,0,0,,The fixed fee is what moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.74,0:00:35.68,Cap,,0,0,0,,It stops hurting at about twenty\Npounds fifty a sale.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.40,0:00:38.00,Cap,,0,0,0,,Our rate isn't one number.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.66,0:00:41.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,It depends entirely on what\Nyou sell things for.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.50,0:00:43.94,Cap,,0,0,0,,So work that out before anyone\Nquotes you anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.48,0:00:45.02,Cap,,0,0,0,,Us included.
